    <section id="sect-00005">
      <title>Additonal Resources</title>
      <section id="sect-00006">
        <title>Solving a System of Equations by Elimination</title>
        <para id="para-00090">Let’s reinforce the steps to solve a system of equations using
          elimination.</para>

        <note id="note-00002">
          <para id="para-00091"><emphasis>Step 1 </emphasis> - Write both equations in standard
          form. If any coefficients are fractions, clear them.</para>
      <para id="para-00092"><emphasis>Step
          2</emphasis> - Check to see if the coefficients of one variable are opposites or
          equivalent.</para>
      <para id="para-00093"><emphasis>Step 3</emphasis> - Add or subtract the
          equations to eliminate one variable.</para>
      <para id="para-00094"><emphasis>Step 4 </emphasis>
          - Solve for the remaining variable.</para>
      <para id="para-00095"><emphasis>Step 5</emphasis>
          - Substitute the solution from Step 4 into one of the original equations. Then solve for
          the other variable.</para>
      <para id="para-00096"><emphasis>Step 6</emphasis> - Write the
          solution as an ordered pair.</para>
      <para id="para-00097"><emphasis>Step 7</emphasis> -
          Check that the ordered pair is a solution to both original equations.</para>
        </note>

        <para id="para-00098"><emphasis>Example</emphasis></para>
        <para id="para-00099">Let’s look at an example. Solve the following system of equations
          using elimination:</para>
        <para id="para-00100"><m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="prefix">{</m:mo>
                <m:mtable>
                  <m:mtr>
                    <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                      <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                      <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                      <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                      <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>24</m:mn>
                    </m:mtd>
                  </m:mtr>
                  <m:mtr>
                    <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                      <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                      <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                      <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>30</m:mn>
                    </m:mtd>
                  </m:mtr>
                </m:mtable>
                <m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="postfix"/>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math></para>
        <para id="para-00101"><emphasis>Step 1</emphasis> - Write both equations in standard form.
          If any coefficients are fractions, clear them. <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="prefix">{</m:mo>
                <m:mtable>
                  <m:mtr>
                    <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                      <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                      <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                      <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                      <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>24</m:mn>
                    </m:mtd>
                  </m:mtr>
                  <m:mtr>
                    <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                      <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                      <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                      <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>30</m:mn>
                    </m:mtd>
                  </m:mtr>
                </m:mtable>
                <m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="postfix"/>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math></para>
        <para id="para-00102"><emphasis>Step 2</emphasis> - Check to see if the coefficients of one
          variable are opposites or equivalent. The coefficients on the <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>-variables are opposites. We can
          add the equations.</para>
        <para id="para-00103"><emphasis>Step 3</emphasis> - Add the equations to eliminate one
          variable. <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mtable>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                    <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                    <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                    <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>24</m:mn>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                    <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                    <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                    <m:mn>30</m:mn>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                    <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                    <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
              </m:mtable>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math></para>
        <para id="para-00104"><emphasis>Step 4</emphasis> - Solve for the remaining variable. <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mtable>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                    <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                    <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                    <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                    <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                    <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
              </m:mtable>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math></para>
        <para id="para-00105"><emphasis>Step 5</emphasis> - Substitute the solution from Step 4 into
          one of the original equations. Then solve for the other variable.
          \begin{array}{rcl}3x-3y&amp;=&amp;-24\\3x-3(3)&amp;=&amp;-24\\3x-9&amp;=&amp;-24\\3x&amp;=&amp;-15\\x&amp;=&amp;-5\end{array}</para>
        <para id="para-00106"><emphasis>Step 6</emphasis> - Write the solution as an ordered pair. <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo>
              <m:mn>5</m:mn>
              <m:mo>,</m:mo>
              <m:mn>3</m:mn>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math></para>
        <para id="para-00107"><emphasis>Step 7</emphasis> - Check that the ordered pair is a
          solution to both original equations.</para>

        <para id="para-00108"><m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mtable>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                    <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                    <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                    <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>24</m:mn>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                    <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                    <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                    <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                    <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                    <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                    <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>24</m:mn>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>15</m:mn>
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>9</m:mn>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                    <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>24</m:mn>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>24</m:mn>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                    <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>24</m:mn>
                    <m:mi>✓</m:mi>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
              </m:mtable>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math></para>
        <para id="para-00109"><m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mtable>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                    <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                    <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                    <m:mn>30</m:mn>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                    <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                    <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                    <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                    <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                    <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                    <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                    <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                    <m:mn>30</m:mn>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                    <m:mn>15</m:mn>
                    <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>15</m:mn>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                    <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                    <m:mn>30</m:mn>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                    <m:mn>30</m:mn>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                    <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                  </m:mtd>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                    <m:mn>30</m:mn>
                    <m:mi>✓</m:mi>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
              </m:mtable>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math></para>

        <section id="sect-00007">
          <note class="try" id="note-00003">
            <title>Solving a System of Equations by Elimination</title>

            <!--Q#-->
        <exercise id="exer-00012">
              <problem id="prob-00020">
                <para id="para-00110">Solve the following system of equations using elimination:</para>
                <para id="para-00111"><m:math>
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="prefix">{</m:mo>
                        <m:mtable>
                          <m:mtr>
                            <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                              <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                              <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                              <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                              <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                              <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                              <m:mn>8</m:mn>
                            </m:mtd>
                          </m:mtr>
                          <m:mtr>
                            <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                              <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                              <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                              <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                              <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                              <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                              <m:mn>17</m:mn>
                            </m:mtd>
                          </m:mtr>
                        </m:mtable>
                        <m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="postfix"/>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:math></para>
                <para id="para-00112"/>
              </problem>
              <solution id="sol-00020">
                <para id="para-00113">Compare your answer: </para>

                <para id="para-00114">Here is how to solve this system of equations using
            elimination:</para>

                <para id="para-00115"><emphasis>Step 1</emphasis> - Write both equations in standard
            form. If any coefficients are fractions, clear them. <m:math display="inline">
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mtable>
                        <m:mtr>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                            <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                            <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                            <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                            <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                            <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                            <m:mn>8</m:mn>
                          </m:mtd>
                        </m:mtr>
                        <m:mtr>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                            <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                            <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                            <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                            <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                            <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                            <m:mn>17</m:mn>
                          </m:mtd>
                        </m:mtr>
                      </m:mtable>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:math></para>

                <para id="para-00116"><emphasis>Step 2</emphasis> - Check to see if the coefficients
            of one variable are opposites or equivalent. The coefficients on the <m:math display="inline">
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:math>-variables
            are opposites. We can add the equations.</para>

                <para id="para-00117"><emphasis>Step 3</emphasis> - Add the equations to eliminate
            one variable. <m:math display="inline">
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mtable>
                        <m:mtr>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                            <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                            <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                            <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mn>8</m:mn>
                          </m:mtd>
                        </m:mtr>
                        <m:mtr>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                            <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                            <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                            <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mn>17</m:mn>
                          </m:mtd>
                        </m:mtr>
                        <m:mtr>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                            <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                            <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                            <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mn>25</m:mn>
                          </m:mtd>
                        </m:mtr>
                      </m:mtable>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:math></para>

                <para id="para-00118"><emphasis>Step 4</emphasis> - Solve for the remaining
            variable. <m:math display="inline">
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mtable>
                        <m:mtr>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                            <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                            <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                            <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mn>25</m:mn>
                          </m:mtd>
                        </m:mtr>
                        <m:mtr>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                            <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                            <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                          </m:mtd>
                        </m:mtr>
                      </m:mtable>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:math></para>

                <para id="para-00119"><emphasis>Step 5</emphasis> - Substitute the solution from
            Step 4 into one of the original equations. Then solve for the other variable. <m:math display="inline">
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mtable>
                        <m:mtr>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                            <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                            <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                            <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mn>8</m:mn>
                          </m:mtd>
                        </m:mtr>
                        <m:mtr>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                            <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                            <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                            <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                            <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                            <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mn>8</m:mn>
                          </m:mtd>
                        </m:mtr>
                        <m:mtr>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                            <m:mn>20</m:mn>
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                            <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                            <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mn>8</m:mn>
                          </m:mtd>
                        </m:mtr>
                        <m:mtr>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                            <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                            <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                            <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                            <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                            <m:mn>12</m:mn>
                          </m:mtd>
                        </m:mtr>
                        <m:mtr>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                            <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                            <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                            <m:mspace width="0.278em"/>
                            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                          </m:mtd>
                        </m:mtr>
                      </m:mtable>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:math></para>

                <para id="para-00120"><emphasis>Step 6</emphasis> - Write the solution as an ordered
            pair. <m:math display="inline">
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                      <m:mo>,</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:math></para>

                <para id="para-00121"><emphasis>Step 7</emphasis> - Check that the ordered pair is a
            solution to both original equations.</para>

                <para id="para-00122"><m:math display="inline">
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mtable>
                        <m:mtr>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                            <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                            <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                            <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                            <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                            <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                            <m:mn>8</m:mn>
                          </m:mtd>
                        </m:mtr>
                        <m:mtr>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                            <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                            <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                            <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                            <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                            <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                            <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                            <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                            <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                            <m:mn>8</m:mn>
                          </m:mtd>
                        </m:mtr>
                        <m:mtr>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="right">
                            <m:mn>20</m:mn>
                            <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                            <m:mn>12</m:mn>
                          </m:mtd>
                          <m:mtd columnalign="center">
                            <m:mo>=</m:mo>
